      "3": "Brown middle-parted swept-back hair/rear bun, separate brows, large round gold-framed brown-tinted spectacles and seven peach-pink polygon-in-dark-hoop gold necklace groups retain actual source. Olive-brown blouse, slight screen-left view/smile/crop/light/full grey vignette match. Smooth noseless/earless green-eyed face, one small grey wedge mouth, compact broad neckline/necklace placement without long stalk/floating accessories or white bib. Tiny chain links/gem facets/lens interior are unreadable source limits, not claimed exact. Full raw/mattes solid255, no visible holes/backing loss.",
      "4": "Short dark swept-back side-parted hair/separate dark brows, clean lip/chin and screen-right cheek scar retain source. Brown broad-lapel suit/light grey pointed shirt/red-grey broad diagonal striped tie, screen-left three-quarter serious expression/crop/light/full dark-grey vignette match. Targeted face crop confirms one grey wedge mouth on smooth yellow facial surface, without discrete human nose bulb/nostrils or extra lips; whole-view suspicion is not a supported defect. Collar wraps short broad throat naturally, no pinching/floating cloth/white bib. Fine scar relief/individual hair and tie weave unreadable limits. Full raw/mattes solid255, no visible holes/backing loss."
